# Both gateway/Dockerfile and console/Dockerfile build from the repo root
# (each needs the sibling proto/ directory), so this applies to both - keeps
# the build context from including things like a local gateway/build/ (a full
# C++ tree with MAVSDK/yaml-cpp, hundreds of MB) or console/node_modules on
# every single docker build invocation.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
console/build
gateway/build
**/*.log
